; =============================================================================
; LOVER LIPS YACHTS — core/.env.staging.example  [DEPRECATED — 2026-07-31]
; =============================================================================
; This file described a 3-tier environment (local / staging / production)
; where staging lived on a separate host (lly.tourfindy.com, GreenGeeks
; shared hosting) with its own database. That tier has been retired.
;
; Current architecture (see core/.env and api/conexion.php's header comment):
;   - There is ONE database: u713871298_lly_db on Hostinger.
;   - The ONLY official production/deployment domain is loverlipsyachts.com.
;   - Local XAMPP dev reaches that same database over TCP
;     (DB_HOST_LOCAL in core/.env) — there is no separate staging DB to
;     configure, and no APP_ENV="staging" branch anywhere in the codebase.
;
; If a genuine pre-production staging tier is reintroduced in the future
; (e.g. a staging.loverlipsyachts.com subdomain with its own database), a
; new template should be authored against that real infrastructure rather
; than reviving this file — it documented lly.tourfindy.com specifically
; and should not be repurposed with placeholder guesses.
;
; See docs/02_SYSTEM_CODEX_REGISTRY.md for the migration record.
; =============================================================================
